Subject: Re: Shiny with grid engine
Message-ID: <CAQAatE2ozM.-I3TKQ5sZscJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <CAQAatE2ozM.mb-8bv5EgR8J@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
