http://localhost:3838/02_text

What were you seeing when you had this section in your Apache config file:

#<VirtualHost *:80>

#    ProxyPass / http://localhost:3838/

#    ProxyPassReverse / http://localhost:3838/

#    #ProxyPreservation On

